ypeNameEn":"Resonance Skill","name":"磁殛咆哮","nameEn":"Magnetic Roar","maxLevel":10,"desc":"磁殛咆哮\n人偶“悬丝”对目标造成导电伤害，并使吟霖进入共鸣技能磁殛状态。\n \n磁殛状态\n·普攻和闪避反击命中目标时，触发1次磁殛爆发；\n·每段普攻和闪避反击仅可触发1次磁殛爆发，最多可触发4次。\n \n磁殛爆发\n攻击所有携带共鸣回路缚罪标记的目标，造成导电伤害。\n \n召雷磁爆\n施放共鸣技能磁殛咆哮后一定时间内，短按共鸣技能，将会施放召雷磁爆攻击目标，造成导电伤害。\n若一定时间内没有施放共鸣技能召雷磁爆或者切换至其他角色，则技能进入冷却状态。","descEn":"Magnetic Roar\nThe puppet \"Zapstring\" deals Electro DMG to the target, and puts Yinlin in Resonance Skill Execution Mode.\n \nExecution Mode\nBasic Attack and Dodge Counter will trigger 1 Electromagnetic Blast when hitting a target.\nEach stage of Basic Attack or Dodge Counter can only trigger 1 Electromagnetic Blast, up to 4 times.\n \nElectromagnetic Blast\nAttack all targets marked with Forte Circuit Sinner's Mark, dealing Electro DMG.\n \nLightning Execution\nUse Resonance Skill after casting Resonance Skill Magnetic Roar to cast Lightning Execution to attack the target, dealing Electro DMG.\nIf Resonance Skill Lightning Execution is not activated in a while or this Character is switched, this Skill will be put on Cooldown.","params":[{"label":"磁殛咆哮伤害","labelEn":"Magnetic Roar Damage","values":["30%*3","32.46%*3","34.92%*3","38.37%*3","40.83%*3","43.66%*3","47.59%*3","51.53%*3","55.47%*3","59.65%*3"]},{"label":"召雷磁爆伤害","labelEn":"Lightning Execution Damage","values":["45%*4","48.69%*4","52.38%*4","57.55%*4","61.24%*4","65.48%*4","71.39%*4","77.29%*4","83.2%*4","89.47%*4"]},{"label":"磁殛爆发伤害","labelEn":"Electromagnetic Blast Damage","values":["10%","10.82%","11.64%","12.79%","13.61%","14.56%","15.87%","17.18%","18.49%","19.89%"]},{"label":"磁殛状态持续时间","labelEn":"Execution Mode Duration","values":["10","10","10","10","10","10","10","10","10","10"]},{"label":"冷却时间","labelEn":"Cooldown","values":["12","12","12","12","12","12","12","12","12","12"]},{"label":"磁殛咆哮回复协奏能量","labelEn":"Magnetic Roar Concerto Regen","values":["10","10","10","10","10","10","10","10","10","10"]},{"label":"召雷磁爆回复协奏能量","labelEn":"Lightning Execution Concerto Regen",