tning Execution is increased by 10% when hitting targets marked with Sinner's Mark, and Yinlin's ATK is increased by 10% for 4s when this is triggered.","params":[],"hits":[],"confidence":"high","skillIcon":"assets/skills/1001505.webp?v=0f4389246012"},{"id":1001506,"type":5,"typeName":"变奏技能","typeNameEn":"Intro Skill","name":"狂雷飓风","nameEn":"Raging Storm","maxLevel":10,"desc":"利用人偶“悬丝”进行攻击，造成大范围的导电伤害。","descEn":"Command puppet \"Zapstring\" to attack, dealing Electro DMG in a large range.","params":[{"label":"技能伤害","labelEn":"Skill DMG","values":["7.2%*10","7.8%*10","8.39%*10","9.21%*10","9.8%*10","10.48%*10","11.43%*10","12.37%*10","13.32%*10","14.32%*10"]},{"label":"回复协奏能量","labelEn":"Concerto Regen","values":["10","10","10","10","10","10","10","10","10","10"]}],"hits":[{"label":"技能伤害","labelEn":"Skill DMG","term":0,"count":10,"multiplier":[0.072,0.078,0.0839,0.0921,0.098,0.1048,0.1143,0.1237,0.1332,0.1432],"damageId":1302050010,"type":"intro","typeId":3,"typeName":"变奏技能","calc":"damage","element":"electro","elementId":3,"scaling":"atk","rateField":"RateLv","flat":null,"energy":[0.2],"concerto":[0.0],"elementPowerType":0,"toughness":[0.0499],"offTune":[0.0952],"hardness":[1.0],"formulaType":0,"subType":[],"damageIds":[1302050010,1302050011],"variants":[{"damageId":1302050011,"type":"intro","typeId":3,"element":"electro","scaling":"atk","flat":null,"energy":[0.2],"concerto":[0.0],"toughness":[0.0499],"offTune":[0.0952]}],"confidence":"high"}],"concertoGain":10.0,"confidence":"high","skillIcon":"assets/skills/1001506.webp?v=d5212be385fe"},{"id":1001507,"type":6,"typeName":"共鸣回路","typeNameEn":"Forte Circuit","name":"千面魅影","nameEn":"Chameleon Cipher","maxLevel":10,"desc":"千面魅影\n当吟霖【审判值】满时，重击将替换为千面魅影，消耗所有【审判值】攻击目标，造成导电伤害，命中携带缚罪标记的目标时，缚罪标记被替换为惩罚印记，持续18秒。千面魅影造成的伤害为重击伤害。\n \n缚罪标记\n常态攻击悬丝华刃舞、共鸣解放破天雷灭击或变奏技能狂雷飓风命中目标时，附加缚罪标记。\n吟霖离场时缚罪标记消失。\n \n惩罚印记\n携带惩罚印记的目标受到伤害时会降下审判之雷，对所有携带惩罚印记的目标造成导电伤害，每秒最多可触发1次。审判之雷造成的伤害为共鸣技能伤害。\n \n审判值\n【审判值】上限100点。\n施放变奏技能狂雷飓风时，回复【审判值】。\n常态攻击悬丝华刃舞命中目标时，回复【审判值】。\n施放共鸣技能磁殛咆哮时，回复【审判值】。\n共鸣技能磁殛爆发命中目标时，回复【审判值】。\n施放共鸣技能召雷磁爆时，回复【审判值】。","descEn":"Chameleon Cipher\nWhen Yinlin's Judgment Points are full, her Heavy Attack is replaced with Chameleon Cipher, which consumes all Judgment Points to attack the target, dealing Electro DMG. When it hits a target marked with Sinner's Mark, the Sinner's Mark is replaced with Punishment Mark, lasting for 18s. Chameleon Cipher deals Heavy Attack DMG.\n \nSinner's Mark\nBasic Attack Zapstring's Dance, Resonance Liberation Thundering Wrath, and Intro Skill Roaring Storm apply Sinner's Mark to the target on hit.\nSinner's Mark is removed when Yinlin is switched out.\n \nPunishment Mark\nWhen a target marked with Punishment Mark takes damage, Judgement Strike will fall, triggering Coordinated Attacks to all targets marked with Punishment Mark, dealing Electro DMG. This can be triggered up to 1 time per second. Judgement Strike deals Resonance Skill DMG.\n \nJudgment Points\nYinlin can hold up to 100 Judgement Points. Yinlin gains Judgement Points through the following ways:\nUpon casting Intro Skill Raging Storm\nWhen Basic Attack Zapstring's Dance hits a target\nUpon casting Resonance Skill Magnetic Roar;\nWhen Resonance Skill Electromagnetic Blast hits a target;\nUpon casting Resonance Skill Lightning Execution.","params":[{"label":"千面魅影伤害","labelEn":"Chameleon Cipher Damage","values":["90%*2","97.38%*2","104.76%*2","115.1%*2","122.48%*2","130.96%*2","142.77%*2","154.58%*2","166.39%*2","178.93%*2"]},{"label":"审判之雷伤害","labelEn":"Judgment Strike Damage","values":["39.56%","42.8%","46.05%","50.59%","53.83%","57.56%","62.75%","67.94%","73.13%","78.64%"]}],"hits":[{"label":"千面魅影伤害","labelEn":"Chameleon Cipher Damage","term":0,"count":2,"multiplier":[0.9,0.9738,1.0476,1.151,1.2248,1.3096,1.4277,1.5458,1.6639,1.7893],"damageId":1302013010,"type":"heavy","typeId":1,"typeName":"重击","calc":"damage","element":"electro","elementId":3,"scaling":"atk","rateField":"RateLv","flat":null,"energy":[5.0],"